# vrc-dcc-workstation — Cursor rules

Authoritative file: root `AGENTS.md`.

Skeleton VRChat DCC station (Blender + Unity 2022.3). No third-party binaries in git.

Init: resolve locale (`docs/I18N.md`) → explore → ask (`templates/INIT_QUESTIONNAIRE.md` or `templates/i18n/<locale>/`) including Q0 language → plan → `bootstrap.ps1` dry-run → `-Apply`. Chat in that locale. Git commits stay English.

MCP: project / `--mcp-config` only. Never user-global. One blender-mcp client at a time.

Human clicks VRChat SDK Build & Publish. Official Unity 6 MCP stays off 2022.3 avatar projects.
